<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  th, td {
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .section-heading {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .signature-block {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    text-align: center;
    width: 45%;
  }
  .signature-line div {
    height: 1px;
    background-color: black;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">
    Wisconsin Technical College System and University of Wisconsin System<br>
    PROGRAM-TO-PROGRAM ARTICULATION AGREEMENT TEMPLATE
  </div>

  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <div>University of Wisconsin (UW) Oshkosh</div>
    <div>Fox Valley Technical College</div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <strong>WTCS Degree Type and Program:</strong><br>
      <span>{{ wtcs_degree_type }}</span>
      <br>
      <strong>UW Degree Type and Major:</strong><br>
      <span>{{ uw_degree_type }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Effective Date:</strong> <span>{{ effective_date }}</span><br>
      <strong>Next Review Date:</strong> <span>{{ next_review_date }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> New Agreement</label>
    <label style="margin-left: 20px;"><input type="checkbox"> Revised Agreement</label>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Agreement Description and Rationale:</div>
  <p>{{ agreement_description }}</p>

  <div class="section-heading">Articulation Transfer Agreement Terms:</div>
  <p>The terms of this agreement apply to <span>{{ fox_valley_college_name }}</span> College students who successfully complete the A.A.S. degree in Software Developer; meet the admission requirements set forth below for UW Oshkosh; and enroll in the B.S. degree with a major in Software Technology.</p>
  <p>A transfer course/credit articulation table illustrating the list of courses the student must complete to earn the B.S. degree with a major in Software Technology at <span>{{ uw_oshkosh_name }}</span>; course/credit requirements fulfilled at <span>{{ fox_valley_college_name }}</span> College; and courses the student must take at <span>{{ uw_oshkosh_name }}</span> may be found in Appendix A.</p>
  <p>In addition, students must meet the following requirements to receive the B.S. degree with a major in Software Technology at <span>{{ uw_oshkosh_name }}</span>:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>The minimum number of credits to earn the B.S. degree from UW Oshkosh is <span>{{ min_credits_uw_oshkosh }}</span>.</li>
    <li>A minimum cumulative GPA of <span>{{ min_gpa }}</span>.</li>
    <li>Upper level course work: A minimum of 35 credits must be completed at the 300-level or above.</li>
    <li>Credits from four-year institutions: A minimum of 48 credits must be earned from four-year institutions. This does not limit the number of credits that can be transferred from WTCS institutions to UW Oshkosh.</li>
    <li>Credits from UW Oshkosh: A minimum of 30 credits must be earned from UW Oshkosh.</li>
  </ul>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Format satisfies UW System Guidelines for Articulation Agreements outlined in the <a href="#">Academic Information Series ACIS 6.2</a></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">
    Wisconsin Technical College System and University of Wisconsin System<br>
    PROGRAM-TO-PROGRAM ARTICULATION AGREEMENT TEMPLATE
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Residency requirement: Completion of <span>{{ residency_requirement }}</span> earned toward the degree must be from UW Oshkosh.</div>
  <div class="section-heading">Satisfactory completion of the degree credit requirements listed in Appendix A.</div>

  <div class="section-heading">Additional coursework completed at <span>{{ fox_valley_college_name }}</span> College may be transferable to satisfy UW Oshkosh education or breadth requirements. These courses are listed in Appendix A or are searchable through the UW System online credit transfer tool, Transferology (<a href="#">https://www.wisconsin.edu/transfer/wizards/</a>).</div>

  <div class="section-heading">Approved by:</div>
  <div class="signature-block">
    <div class="signature-line">
      <div></div>
      <div>Dr. {{ signature_name_1 }}</div>
      <div>Dean, College of Letters and Science</div>
    </div>
    <div class="signature-line">
      <div></div>
      <div>Dr. {{ signature_name_2 }}</div>
      <div>Provost and Vice Chancellor, Academic Affairs</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="signature-block" style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <div class="signature-line">
      <div></div>
      <div>Dr. {{ signature_name_3 }}</div>
      <div>Chancellor</div>
    </div>
    <div class="signature-line">
      <div></div>
      <div>Dr. {{ signature_name_4 }}</div>
      <div>Vice President for Learning and Chief Academic Officer</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px;">
    <p>Format satisfies UW System Guidelines for Articulation Agreements outlined in the <a href="#">Academic Information Series ACIS 6.2</a></p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="header-title">
    Appendix A
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>University of Wisconsin (UW) Oshkosh</div>
    <div>WTCS Degree Type and Program: A.A.S. in Software Developer</div>
    <div>UW Degree Type and Major: B.S. with a major in Software Technology</div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div>
      <strong>Transfer Course/Credit Articulation Table:</strong>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Fox Valley Technical College Courses/Credits</th>
            <th>UW Oshkosh Requirements</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td><strong>Table 1: General Education / Breadth Requirements*</strong></td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Course</th>
                    <th>Title</th>
                    <th>Gen Ed Area</th>
                    <th>Cr.</th>
                    <th>Course</th>
                    <th>Title</th>
                    <th>Gen Ed Area</th>
                    <th>Cr.</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {% for item in general_education_courses %}
                  <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_code">{{ item.course_code }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ item.title }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].gen_ed_area">{{ item.gen_ed_area }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_code_2">{{ item.course_code_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title_2">{{ item.title_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].gen_ed_area_2">{{ item.gen_ed_area_2 }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits_2">{{ item.credits_2 }}</span></td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </td>
            <td>
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Course</th>
                    <th>Title</th>
                    <th>Gen Ed Area</th>
                    <th>Cr.</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  {% for item in uw_general_education_courses %}
                  <tr>
                    <td><span data-field="uw_general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_code">{{ item.course_code }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="uw_general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ item.title }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="uw_general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].gen_ed_area">{{ item.gen_ed_area }}</span></td>
                    <td><span data-field="uw_general_education_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
                  </tr>
                  {% endfor %}
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td style="text-align: right;">
              <strong>General Education Credits Transferred:</strong> <span>{{ total_gen_ed_transferred }}</span>
            </td>
            <td>
              <strong>Credits to Take at UW Oshkosh:</strong> <span>{{ total_gen_ed_to_take }}</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </td>
  </div>

  <p style="font-size: small;">*Additional coursework not listed here may be transferable to satisfy general education or breadth requirements and are searchable at UW System online credit transfer tool, Transferology (<a href="#">https://www.wisconsin.edu/transfer/wizards/</a>).</p>

  <div class="section-heading">Table 2: Major Program Requirements</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Title</th>
        <th>Cr.</th>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Title</th>
        <th>Cr.</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in major_transfer_courses %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="major_transfer_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_code">{{ item.course_code }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_transfer_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ item.title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_transfer_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_transfer_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_code_2">{{ item.course_code_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_transfer_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title_2">{{ item.title_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="major_transfer_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits_2">{{ item.credits_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
    <div>
      <strong>Major Program Credits Transferred:</strong> <span>{{ total_major_transferred }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Credits to Take at UW Oshkosh:</strong> <span>{{ total_major_to_take }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Table 3: Other Courses</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Title</th>
        <th>Cr.</th>
        <th>Course</th>
        <th>Title</th>
        <th>Cr.</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in other_courses %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="other_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_code">{{ item.course_code }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ item.title }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits">{{ item.credits }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].course_code_2">{{ item.course_code_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].title_2">{{ item.title_2 }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="other_courses[{{ loop.index0 }}].credits_2">{{ item.credits_2 }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
    <div>
      <strong>Total Transfer Credits:</strong> <span>{{ total_transfer_credits }}</span>
    </div>
    <div>
      <strong>Total Credits to Take at UW Oshkosh:</strong> <span>{{ total_credits_to_take_uw_oshkosh }}</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">Notes:</div>
  <ol>
    <li>These elective credits may be used to satisfy total credit requirements for the B.S. degree (120 credits minimum).</li>
    <li>These elective credits may be used to satisfy total credit requirements for the B.S. degree (120 credits minimum), and additionally count as 300 level courses. The Department of Computer Science will write a curriculum modification that enables this requirement to be satisfied for transfer students who have completed the Associate of Applied Science degree in Software Developer at FVTC.</li>
    <li>MATH 104 or another course that satisfies the MATH requirement of the University Studies Program at UW Oshkosh.</li>
    <li>These courses must follow the approved Natural Sciences pairing requirements.</li>
    <li>These courses can be cross listed as either an (SS) or (HU) course and will then double count in those categories also.</li>
  </ol>

  <p style="margin-top: 40px;">Questions regarding this agreement may be directed to:</p>
  <p>Chair, Computer Science<br>
  Department of Computer Science<br>
  <span>{{ department_email }}</span> 920-424-2068</p>

  <p style="margin-top: 50px;">Format satisfies UW System Guidelines for Articulation Agreements outlined in the <a href="#">Academic Information Series ACIS 6.2</a></p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <h1>Signature Requested | FVTC--UWO Software Tech 07-01-22</h1>
    <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 20px;">
      <div>Created: <span>{{ created_date }}</span></div>
      <div>2022-07-05</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-heading">"Signature Requested | FVTC--UWO Software Tech 07-01-22" H history</div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p>📄 Document created by <span>{{ creator_name }}</span> ({{ creator_email }})</p>
    <p>Date: <span>{{ creation_date_time }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p>📄 Document emailed to <span>{{ recipient_name }}</span> ({{ recipient_email }}) for signature</p>
    <p>Date: <span>{{ email_date_time }}</span></p>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <p>📧 Email viewed by <span>{{ viewer_name }}</span> ({{ viewer_email }})</p>
